{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "序"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "終"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "謝辭不錄。"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "十二首"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "終"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "門人悟培　妙卓　淨玉　達意\n　　　　　　憨拙　悟元　海進　印中\n　　　　　　性本　深玫\n　　　弟子劉淨敵　陶淨尚　王淨參同捐資敬刻\n　　本師和尚語錄全部　　　侍者德芳對\n　　康熙藏在辛未菊月　嘉興府楞嚴寺藏經坊存板"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "學副"}
